{
  "lesson_title": "Palindrome Check with Two-Pointer Technique",
  "steps": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "visual_action": "intro",
      "trace_event_index": 0,
      "narration_text": "The algorithm checks if a given string reads the same forwards and backwards. This is known as a palindrome check. We'll walk through the execution on the input 'RACECAR'.",
      "duration_seconds": 8.212,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 1,
      "visual_action": "variable_init",
      "trace_event_index": 1,
      "narration_text": "The input string 'RACECAR' is stored in the variable input.",
      "duration_seconds": 5.278,
      "variable_name": "input"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "visual_action": "data_structure_update",
      "trace_event_index": 2,
      "narration_text": "The string is converted to a character array 'chars' for indexed access.",
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "variable_name": "chars"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "visual_action": "method_call",
      "trace_event_index": 3,
      "narration_text": "The method isPalindrome is called with the input.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.581,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "visual_action": "variable_init",
      "trace_event_index": 4,
      "narration_text": "The left pointer is initialized to 0, the start of the array.",
      "duration_seconds": 5.269,
      "variable_name": "left"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "visual_action": "variable_init",
      "trace_event_index": 5,
      "narration_text": "The right pointer is initialized to 6, the last index of the array (length - 1).",
      "duration_seconds": 5.193,
      "variable_name": "right"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "visual_action": "highlight",
      "trace_event_index": 5,
      "narration_text": "The core idea is the two-pointer technique: compare characters at left and right indices. If they differ, it's not a palindrome. If they match, move left forward and right backward, repeating until the pointers meet or cross.",
      "duration_seconds": 10.302,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "visual_action": "condition_eval",
      "trace_event_index": 6,
      "narration_text": "The loop condition left < right is evaluated. Since 0 < 6 is true, the loop body executes.",
      "duration_seconds": 6.535,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "visual_action": "loop_iteration",
      "trace_event_index": 7,
      "narration_text": "First iteration of the loop begins.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "visual_action": "array_access",
      "trace_event_index": 8,
      "narration_text": "The character at index left (0) is read: 'R'.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.487,
      "variable_name": "chars[0]"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "visual_action": "array_access",
      "trace_event_index": 9,
      "narration_text": "The character at index right (6) is read: 'R'.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.594,
      "variable_name": "chars[6]"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "visual_action": "compare",
      "trace_event_index": 10,
      "narration_text": "The characters are compared: 'R' != 'R' evaluates to false, so they match and the method does not return early.",
      "duration_seconds": 5.256,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "visual_action": "move_pointer",
      "trace_event_index": 11,
      "narration_text": "After the successful comparison, the left pointer moves inward to 1.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.847,
      "variable_name": "left"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "visual_action": "move_pointer",
      "trace_event_index": 12,
      "narration_text": "The right pointer moves inward to 5.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": "right"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "visual_action": "condition_eval",
      "trace_event_index": 13,
      "narration_text": "The loop condition is evaluated again: left=1 < right=5 is true, so the loop continues.",
      "duration_seconds": 3.515,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "visual_action": "loop_iteration",
      "trace_event_index": 14,
      "narration_text": "Second iteration begins.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "visual_action": "array_access",
      "trace_event_index": 15,
      "narration_text": "Character at index 1 is read: 'A'.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": "chars[1]"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "visual_action": "array_access",
      "trace_event_index": 16,
      "narration_text": "Character at index 5 is read: 'A'.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": "chars[5]"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "visual_action": "compare",
      "trace_event_index": 17,
      "narration_text": "Comparison: 'A' != 'A' is false, they match.",
      "duration_seconds": 3.068,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "visual_action": "move_pointer",
      "trace_event_index": 18,
      "narration_text": "Left pointer moves to 2.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": "left"
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "visual_action": "move_pointer",
      "trace_event_index": 19,
      "narration_text": "Right pointer moves to 4.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": "right"
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "visual_action": "condition_eval",
      "trace_event_index": 20,
      "narration_text": "Loop condition: left=2 < right=4 is true.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.122,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "visual_action": "loop_iteration",
      "trace_event_index": 21,
      "narration_text": "Third iteration begins.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "visual_action": "array_access",
      "trace_event_index": 22,
      "narration_text": "Character at index 2 is read: 'C'.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": "chars[2]"
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "visual_action": "array_access",
      "trace_event_index": 23,
      "narration_text": "Character at index 4 is read: 'C'.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": "chars[4]"
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "visual_action": "compare",
      "trace_event_index": 24,
      "narration_text": "Comparison: 'C' != 'C' is false, they match.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.886,
      "variable_name": null
    },
    {
      "order": 26,
      "visual_action": "move_pointer",
      "trace_event_index": 25,
      "narration_text": "Left pointer moves to 3.",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "variable_name": "left"
    },
    {
      "order": 27,
      "visual_action": "move_pointer",
      "trace_event_index": 26,
